1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 exd5 4. Nf3 (4. c4 {What's the strategic problem of
this move?} Nf6 5. Nf3 Be7 6. Be2 (6. cxd5 Nxd5 {[%csl Rd4,Gd5]}) (6. c5 b6 {
[%csl Rc5]} 7. b4 {How do we break the pawn chain?} (7. cxb6 axb6 {[%cal Ga8a1]
})) 6... dxc4 {Now we win a tempo}) 4... Nc6 (4... Bd6 $5) (4... Bg4 $5) 5. Be2
Bd6 (5... Bg4 $5) 6. O-O Nge7 {Our setup is} 7. Kh1 Bg4 8. Kg1 Qd7 9. Kh1 O-O-O
10. Kg1 f6 11. Kh1 g5 12. Kg1 h5 *

