Bg5 h6 5. Bh4 (5. Bxf6 Qxf6 6. e5 (6. exd5 Bb4 7. dxe6 Bxe6 {What's our plan?})
6... Qd8 {[%csl Rb2,Gb6,Gc5,Rd4][%cal Gc7c5,Gd8b6]}) 5... g5 6. Bg3 {Grab the
pawn the way you like :)} dxe4 $5 (6... Nxe4 $5)) 4... Ng8 $5 (4... Nfd7 $5 5.
f4 c5 6. Nf3 Nc6 7. Be3 a6 {[%csl Gb5][%cal Gb7b5]} (7... Qb6 $5)) 5. f4 {
How do we play after 5.f4?} (5. Nf3 c5 6. dxc5 Bxc5 7. Bd3 Nc6 8. O-O Nge7 $2 {
What's the key move we should do before playing Nge7? How we should secure the
a7-g1 diagonale for our bishop?}) (5. Be3 Ne7 6. Nf3 Nf5 {[%csl Gc5,Re3][%cal
Gc7c5]}) (5. Nce2 Bd7 6. Ng3 a6 {[%csl Gb5][%cal Gd7b5]}) *

