1. d4 e6 {A smart move order} 2. Bf4 (2. Nf3 f5 3. Bf4 Nf6 {[%csl Gb6][%cal
Gb7b6] Transposition}) 2... f5 3. e3 Nf6 4. Nf3 b6 $1 (4... d6 $5 5. Be2 Nc6 6.
O-O Qe7 {[%cal Gh7h6,Gg7g5,Gf8g7]}) 5. Be2 Bb7 6. O-O {We have different
options} (6. h3 {We're always happy to see this move. Our attack will be
faster, as the "h3" will be a nice target for us.  We have different options.}
d6 $5 (6... Be7 7. O-O Ne4 $5 {[%cal Gd7d6,Gb8d7,Gg7g5,Gh7h5]} (7... O-O 8. c4
Ne4 {[%cal Gg7g5,Gh7h5]})) 7. O-O Nbd7 8. c3 Ne4 {[%csl Rh3][%cal Gg7g5,Gh7h5,
Gg5g4]}) 6... Be7 (6... d6 $5 {[%cal Gb8d7,Gd8e7,Gf6e4,Gg7g5]}) 7. c4 Ne4 {
[%csl Gd6,Gg5][%cal Gd7d6,Gg7g5]} (7... d6 $2 8. Ng5) *

