1. d4 e6 2. c4 f5 3. Nf3 (3. a3 Nf6 4. Nc3 b6 5. Nf3 Bb7) 3... Nf6 4. Nc3 Bb4
$1 {Now if they allow us to take on c3 and double their pawns, we do that.} (
4... b6 $5 {is also fine, but I prefer to get rid of the dark-squared bishop
as soon as possible.}) 5. Bg5 (5. e3 Bxc3+) (5. Bf4 Bxc3+ 6. bxc3 b6 $5 (6...
O-O $5 {[%cal Gb7b6]})) (5. Bd2 b6 $5 {I like delaying 0-0 and showing our
cards} (5... O-O 6. a3 Bxc3 7. Bxc3 b6) 6. a3 Bxc3 7. Bxc3 Bb7) 5... Bxc3+ 6.
bxc3 h6 {[%csl Rg5] Asking to show the cards} 7. Bxf6 (7. Bh4 $2 g5 8. Bg3 f4 {
[%csl Rg3]}) 7... Qxf6 {[%csl Rc3,Rc4]} *

